        "summary": "2-Dy shows decreasing χMT on cooling, magnetic anisotropy, and slow magnetization relaxation at zero dc field; χM″ is frequency-dependent without peaks in 1.8–20 K (fast QTM). Approximate single-relaxation fit gives Ea ≈ 3.2 K and τ0 ≈ 1.4 × 10−3 s, outside the typical SMM τ0 range.",
